--append onto a key holding a scalar is a user error: named on stderr, exit 1, file untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --append status=done
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: cannot append to scalar key 'status' in plan.md
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
